known_false_positives.description:
`std::optional` is used in this header but there is no `#include <optional>` here. Relying on transitive includes is brittle and can cause compile failures depending on include order. Please include `<optional>` in this header (or ensure another directly-included header guarantees it).

```suggestion
    #include <optional>

    std::optional<SetProcessingResponseIndexes> prepareSetProcessingRequests(Coordination::Requests & requests);
```
